1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,721
Learn Anywhere is for learners who want useful skills but have limited internet access.

2
00:00:05,861 --> 00:00:09,295
It brings practical lessons to their phone, at their own pace.

3
00:00:10,383 --> 00:00:14,516
When a connection drops or data runs out, learning can stop halfway through.

4
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:19,366
Learn Anywhere keeps saved text lessons on the device, ready to reopen offline.

5
00:00:20,379 --> 00:00:23,156
On Discover, choose a course and open its lessons.

6
00:00:23,288 --> 00:00:29,367
Save the pack while connected, then return to the text and practical activities without downloading it again.

7
00:00:30,366 --> 00:00:34,673
Here is the key moment: tap the lightbulb to switch to a shorter explained version.

8
00:00:34,801 --> 00:00:36,344
Tap again for the full lesson.

9
00:00:36,472 --> 00:00:39,372
Seven languages support a more comfortable start.

10
00:00:40,370 --> 00:00:49,371
Codex helped build the Flutter app and backend, check the learning flows, and create original course drafts, the screenshot guide, and this narrated app demonstration.

11
00:00:50,347 --> 00:00:56,313
Next, I want to test with learners, improve translations through bilingual review, and expand the course library.

12
00:00:56,435 --> 00:00:59,379
Learn Anywhere: choose a topic, save it, and keep learning.

